WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.750
Module three is Privileged Identity
Management, self-request with approval.

2
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.050
An eligible role is only as safe
as the moment it turns active.

3
00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:13.016
That moment needs fresh proof,
a reason, a second person,

4
00:00:13.016 --> 00:00:16.250
and a record that outlives
the audit window.
